{"id":"182f419f9159dc92","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-frame-heyting-implication.md","title":"Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵","display":"Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-frame-heyting-implication","aliases":["14-df-frame-heyting-implication"],"display":"Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-frame-heyting-implication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-frame-heyting-implication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"382a1dd68ab6f77b\" href=\"?note=382a1dd68ab6f77b\" title=\"14-df-frame\">14-df-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"382a1dd68ab6f77b\" href=\"?note=382a1dd68ab6f77b\" title=\"14-df-frame\">14-df-frame</a> 的框架；所有下式上确界均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 中子集的上确界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in|L|\">\\(a,b,c\\in|L|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L\">\\(\\bot_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 为该框架的底元、二元下确界及次序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_L b:=\\bigvee\\{c\\in|L|\\mid c\\wedge a\\le b\\},\\qquad\\neg_La:=a\\Rightarrow_L\\bot_L,\\qquad c\\le(a\\Rightarrow_Lb)\\Longleftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\le b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\Rightarrow_L b:=\\bigvee\\{c\\in|L|\\mid c\\wedge a\\le b\\},\\qquad\\neg_La:=a\\Rightarrow_L\\bot_L,\\qquad c\\le(a\\Rightarrow_Lb)\\Longleftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\le b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.1。分配律使候选集合的上确界仍满足与 a 之交≤b，因此确为右伴随。每个框架由此成为完备 Heyting 代数，定义及其伴随性质都已明示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame","status":"resolved","id":"382a1dd68ab6f77b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame","status":"resolved","id":"382a1dd68ab6f77b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[14-df-frame]] 的框架；所有下式上确界均是 $|L|$ 中子集的上确界。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"|L|","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in|L|","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"a\\Rightarrow_L b:=\\bigvee\\{c\\in|L|\\mid c\\wedge a\\le b\\},\\qquad\\neg_La:=a\\Rightarrow_L\\bot_L,\\qquad c\\le(a\\Rightarrow_Lb)\\Longleftrightarrow c\\wedge a\\le b.","display":true}],"bytes":911,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-heyting-implication|Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-heyting-implication]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 为小 locale，$L=\\mathcal O(X)$，$u\\in|L|$。$\\Rightarrow_L$ 为 [[14-df-frame-heyting-implication]] 的框架蕴涵；框架、同态、右伴随、locale 嵌入和固定点框架的签名见所列直接依赖。$D_u,H_u,L_{\\downarrow u},L_{\\uparrow u}$ 是下式构造；新运算均在所写载体上取值，$S$ 为对应载体的任意子集，允许为空。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-heyting-implication|Definition — 框架的 Heyting 蕴涵]]"}],"outgoing":["382a1dd68ab6f77b"]}